145
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:27,439
for a thousand years, pegging out diapers and singing rubbish.

146
00:09:27,439 --> 00:09:30,738
It struck him as a curious fact that he had never heard a member of the Party

147
00:09:30,738 --> 00:09:35,840
singing alone and spontaneously. It would even have seemed slightly unorthodox, a

148
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:38,840
dangerous eccentricity, like talking to oneself.

149
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:42,439
Perhaps it was only when people were somewhere near the starvation level that

150
00:09:42,439 --> 00:09:45,199
they had anything to sing about.

151
00:09:45,199 --> 00:09:48,260
'You can turn around now,' said Julia.

152
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:52,100
He turned round, and for a second almost failed to recognize her.

153
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:55,340
What he had actually expected was to see her naked.

154
00:09:55,340 --> 00:09:57,139
But she was not naked.

155
00:09:57,139 --> 00:10:01,040
The transformation that had happened was much more surprising than that. She had

156
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,959
painted her face.

157
00:10:02,959 --> 00:10:06,139
She must have slipped into some shop in the proletarian quarters and bought

158
00:10:06,139 --> 00:10:08,898
herself a complete set of makeup materials.

159
00:10:08,898 --> 00:10:13,579
Her lips were deeply reddened, her cheeks rouged, her nose powdered; there was even

160
00:10:13,579 --> 00:10:16,340
a touch of something under the eyes to make them brighter.

161
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:21,318
It was not very skillfully done, but Winston's standards in such matters were not high.

162
00:10:21,318 --> 00:10:26,359
He had never before seen or imagined a woman of the Party with cosmetics on her face.

163
00:10:26,359 --> 00:10:29,180
The improvement in her appearance was startling.

164
00:10:29,180 --> 00:10:32,540
With just a few dabs of color in the right places she had become not only

165
00:10:32,540 --> 00:10:36,559
very much prettier, but, above all, far more feminine.

166
00:10:36,559 --> 00:10:40,579
Her short hair and boyish overalls merely added to the effect.

167
00:10:40,579 --> 00:10:45,379
As he took her in his arms a wave of synthetic violets flooded his nostrils.

168
00:10:45,379 --> 00:10:50,359
He remembered the half darkness of a basement kitchen, and a woman's cavernous mouth.

169
00:10:50,359 --> 00:10:54,620
It was the very same sense that she had used; but at the moment it did not seem

170
00:10:54,620 --> 00:10:58,459
to matter sent two he said.

171
00:10:58,459 --> 00:11:01,939
'Yes, dear sent to And you know what I'm going to do next?

172
00:11:01,939 --> 00:11:06,020
I'm going to get hold of a real woman's frock from somewhere and wear it instead

173
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:07,760
of these bloody trousers.

174
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:12,079
I'll wear silk stockings and high-heeled shoes! In this room I'm going to be a

175
00:11:12,079 --> 00:11:14,379
woman, not a Party comrade.'

176
00:11:14,379 --> 00:11:18,920
They flung their clothes off and climbed into the huge mahogany bed.

177
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:22,760
It was the first time that he had stripped himself naked in her presence.

178
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:26,898
Until now he had been too much ashamed of his pale and Amiga body, with the

179
00:11:26,898 --> 00:11:31,459
varicose veins standing out on his calves in the discolored patch over his ankle.

180
00:11:31,459 --> 00:11:35,540
There were no sheets, but the blanket they lay on was thread bare and smooth,

181
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:40,159
and the size and springiness of the bed astonished both of them.

182
00:11:40,159 --> 00:11:44,238
'It's sure to be full of bugs, but who cares?' said Julia.

183
00:11:44,238 --> 00:11:48,500
One never saw a double bed nowadays, except in the homes of the pros

184
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:53,120
Winston had occasionally slept in one in his boyhood: Julia had never been in one

185
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:56,299
before, so far as she could remember.

186
00:11:56,299 --> 00:11:58,879
Presently they fell asleep for a little while.

187
00:11:58,879 --> 00:12:03,379
When Winston woke up at the hands of the clock had crept round to nearly nine. He

188
00:12:03,379 --> 00:12:07,879
did not stir, because Julia was sleeping with her head in the crook of his arm.

189
00:12:07,879 --> 00:12:11,359
Most of her makeup had transferred itself to his own face or the bolster,

190
00:12:11,359 --> 00:12:16,279
but a light stain of rouge still brought out the beauty of her cheekbone.

191
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:20,059
A yellow ray from the sinking sun fell across the foot of the bed and lighted

192
00:12:20,059 --> 00:12:24,559
