216
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:59,359
Yes, they do. In some of these streets a woman don't leave a baby alone for two minutes.

217
00:13:59,359 --> 00:14:03,199
It's the great huge brown ones that do it. And the nasty thing is that the

218
00:14:03,199 --> 00:14:07,699
